## Future Enhancements

- **Format selector in UI** — the Kit extension already supports `format: "jpeg" | "png"` in the request payload; adding a UI toggle/dropdown would let users choose lossless PNG when needed
- **JPEG quality slider** — currently hardcoded to 95; could be exposed as a UI control
- **HDR/EXR capture** — `capture_viewport_to_buffer` supports `is_hdr=True`; would need a new format path and appropriate encoding
- **Cloud storage** — when cloud infrastructure is available, captures could be uploaded to object storage instead of served from the Kit instance directly

